  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Australia Transition to Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PNG Australia Transition to Health is Australia&#x2019;s mechanism for delivering technical assistance and grants to the PNG health sector in line with both the Government of Australia and PNG&#x2019;s outcomes for health in Papua New Guinea.  The investment is designed to be a facility based delivery mechanism.   It is envisaged that the investment though the managing contractor will perform four main functions in support of delivering these outcomes: Design and management of sub-programs, provision of high quality technical assistance, provision of high quality policy advice to DFAT and grant management.  The investment is designed to be a facility based delivery mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
